doc: A busy repo shows every panel at once, and number keys move focus between them
given busy
when keys 1
then panel = status
then overview = Sync=↑2 ↓1 vs origin/feat/login Files=1 staged · 3 unstaged Peers=— Stashes=4 Notes=doing.md: wip Template=v0.9.1 → v0.10.0 PRs=#42 Add login flow CI=—
when keys 2
then panel = branches
when keys 3
then panel = prs
when keys 4
then panel = peers
when keys 5
then panel = stashes
when keys 6
then panel = notes
